          "ask": {
            "definition": "The genome of the spike-in DNA that spike-in normalisation counts: E. coli (K12-MG1655, carried over from the enzyme prep), yeast (R64-1-1) or fruit fly (BDGP6) when the protocol added its own.",
            "on_conflict": "The protocol and the libraries' notes name different spike-in DNA. Which was added: yeast, fruit fly, or none (E. coli carry-over)?",
            "on_absent": "not used: with no added spike-in named, normalisation counts the E. coli DNA carried over from the enzyme prep"
          }
